  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d44bf984-5b12-5906-94b4-5a661fb806aa" activityNameId="13407b4f-ca6b-5948-940e-1110c3939c54" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roundwood, paraná pine (SFM), under bark, u=50%, at forest road</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roundwood, paraná pine (SFM), under bark, u=50%, at forest road
dataset represents average of two well-documented, large-scale logging companies. both companies own also natural forests where (some) Paraná pine is extracted. Percentage of plantation trees and trees from managed natural forests as well as intensity of management are not known. Data of the two companies differs considerably. emissions from biomass burning according to IPCC 2003\nTechnology: state-of-the art technology;
Synonyms: Araucaria angustifolia; 
UUID: b296356a-a91d-31f9-a68b-f27f6f5fb8f7
includes plantation establishment and management, harvesting and  hauling operations incl. emissions from burning of branchings; fuel consumption and gravel for forest road construction is unknown; land use of forest roads and gravel are distregarded; branchings are left to rot on the ground
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: state-of-the art technology; forest operations largely based on manual labor, some mechanisation is currently undertaken
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature, partly relying on estimates (fuel consumption) 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b296356a-a91d-31f9-a68b-f27f6f5fb8f7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
